      <p class="kicker">Help when you need it</p>
      <h1>Support</h1>
      <p class="lede">Tell us what happened, which screen you were on, and the approximate time. Do not email passwords, one-time codes, or private photos.</p>
      <p><a class="button button--yellow" href="mailto:wongislandd@gmail.com?subject=Sidequests%20support">Email support</a></p>
      <h2>Photo still checking</h2><p>Keep the app open briefly, then return to the quest. Sidequests stores pending work privately and retries when a connection is available. If the status does not change, include the quest name and time in your support message.</p>
      <h2>Safety or content concern</h2><p>Use the in-app report and block controls when available. For an urgent privacy or safety issue, email <a href="mailto:wongislandd@gmail.com?subject=Sidequests%20safety">wongislandd@gmail.com</a>.</p>
      <h2>Account and privacy</h2><p>See the <a href="/sidequests/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> or <a href="/sidequests/delete-account/">account deletion instructions</a>.</p>
    </main>
    <footer class="site-footer shell"><span>© 2026 Sidequests NYC · Typical support target: two business days</span><nav aria-label="Footer links"><a href="/sidequests/">Home</a><a href="/sidequests/privacy/">Privacy</a><a href="/sidequests/terms/">Terms</a></nav></footer>
